26-01
00:32:35.201 --> 00:32:38.892
It is your turn to perform the complete investigation.

26-02
00:32:39.072 --> 00:32:42.869
Allow about eighteen minutes of independent work here.

26-03
00:32:43.049 --> 00:32:49.833
Open Lab Three in a separate tab and complete D one through D five on
