26-04
00:32:50.013 --> 00:32:53.427
Reproduce the clean reference at forty one points.

26-05
00:32:53.607 --> 00:32:57.895
Compare canceling errors at amplitude zero point two five.

26-06
00:32:58.075 --> 00:33:03.621
Then compare the localized defect at forty one and one hundred sixty
one points.

26-07
00:33:03.801 --> 00:33:08.388
Keep the dataset and amplitude fixed during those comparisons.

26-08
00:33:08.568 --> 00:33:14.797
Finally return to the clean reference at forty one points and run the
modeling test once.

26-09
00:33:14.977 --> 00:33:22.511
Record the path, settings, area percentage, local score, and the
reason for any unavailable verdict.

26-10
00:33:22.691 --> 00:33:29.603
Under E one, retain a local-residual plot and annotate the composition
